-- Trigger fixes: DG 'wait N' (a bare number) is N pulses = tenths of a second, so converted scripts now call wait(N/10) instead of wait(N); DG switch/case with grouped labels, fallthrough and default is translated correctly (fierymud-rs #163, #165). Needs the fractional wait(n) in mud-script (branch wait-fractional-seconds); on the old binary wait(0.2) rounds up to 1s, still never slower than before.
--
-- Idempotent: a row already holding the new body is left alone, so rerunning
-- updates nothing. Keyed by the composite primary key (zone_id, id).
-- Guarded: a row is only touched while it still holds the previous committed
-- body (md5), so rows edited in Muditor since then are left alone.

BEGIN;

UPDATE "Triggers" AS t
SET commands = v.commands,
    updated_at = now()
FROM (VALUES
